  "short_description": "AhsayCBS backup servers contain two remotely exploitable unauthenticated flaws (CVE-2026-105133, CVE-2026-105134): an authentication bypass in the system-password check of the API and an operating-system command injection in the Replication Receiver API, which together allow unauthenticated remote code execution. The first patch round did not fully fix either flaw, so appliances patched once remain vulnerable.",
